Description: Intel Edge NPU metapackage
 Installs the Intel Edge NPU runtime and related components.
 This package is a metapackage and contains no payload files.

Package: intel-edge-compute-extra
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
# clinfo is installed from Ubuntu archive
 clinfo,
 intel-gsc (= 1.2.0-1~24.04~ppa1),
 intel-metrics-discovery (= 1.14.188-1~24.04~ppa1),
 intel-opencl-icd (= 26.27.39122.14-1~24.04~ppa1),
 libze-intel-gpu1 (= 26.27.39122.14-1~24.04~ppa1),
 libze1 (= 1.32.0-1~24.04~ppa1),
# libze-dev and intel-ocloc are needed for ahead-of-time (AoT) compilation,
# such as building SYCL or PyTorch applications from source or precompiling
# kernels for a specific device with -device bmg
 libze-dev (= 1.32.0-1~24.04~ppa1),
 intel-ocloc (= 26.27.39122.14-1~24.04~ppa1)
# The following packages are also pulled in as dependencies: libigc2,
# libigdfcl2, libigdgmm12 (from intel-edge-media), libigsc1, libmetee-dev,
# libmetee6, and ocl-icd-libopencl1 (from Ubuntu archive).
Description: Intel Edge compute extra metapackage
 Installs Intel Edge compute runtime and related tools for Intel GPU workloads.
 This package is a metapackage and contains no payload files.
